= Deep Learning (Spring, 2018-2019)

~~~
This is the homepage of \Deep Learning\ course (Spring, 2018-2019) given by [http://web.eecs.umich.edu/~yinw/ Prof. Yin Wang] from Department of Computer Science and Technology, School of Electrical and Information Engineering.
Due to the rapid development of natural language processing (NLP), we will also add more about this in the semester.
We welcome student from any major besides Computer Science.
~~~

